  "prompt": "For each Headphones or Earbuds product (category_id 15 or 16) sold in 2025, split its units into those sold with a promotion (order_lines.promo_id not missing) and those sold without, and show the promotion share. order_ts holds UTC time, and 2025 runs from 1 January to 31 December in UTC. Return four columns, in this order: product_id, promo_units, full_price_units and promo_share_pct, the promotion units as a percentage of all its 2025 units (12.5 for 12.5%), rounded to 1 decimal. A product with no units of a kind shows 0 there. Return one row for each such product. Any row order is fine.",
